    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Setting</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Blue Council</strong>, <strong>The Arcanium</strong>, or <strong>The Cult of Chao</strong>s as an up-and-coming Castlemancer! Protect your castles, navigate through an expansive map, and rise through the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other deckbuilders, your cards are <strong>literally</strong> your weapons! Drag and drop powerful <strong>spells</strong>, <strong>units</strong>, and <strong>traps</strong>\u00a0to create crazy builds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of <strong>many powerful wizards</strong>, build your deck, and see how far you can get!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Castlemancer you were meant to be!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Setting</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/fdc5696835085fed54c1e753b676dcb5.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Blue Council</strong>, <strong>The Arcanium</strong>, or <strong>The Cult of Chao</strong>s as an up-and-coming Castlemancer! Protect your castles, navigate through an expansive map, and rise through the ranks!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/2bcb77f3da9e00c78bf9adfc87caab03.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other deckbuilders, your cards are <strong>literally</strong> your weapons! Drag and drop powerful <strong>spells</strong>, <strong>units</strong>, and <strong>traps</strong>\u00a0to create crazy builds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.poster.avif?t=1749252642\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.webm?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463450/extras/721caae9cc600e0b240a4e12d80a25dd.mp4?t=1749252642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of <strong>many powerful wizards</strong>, build your deck, and see how far you can get!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Castlemancer you were meant to be!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
